---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import Section from '@/components/Section.astro';
---

<Base head={{ title: 'About | Anshu Man', description: 'The person behind the projects: software, work, books, philosophy, music, and a few ongoing questions.', canonical: 'https://ansh0eman.in/about/' }}>
	<Section>
		<main class="about-page">
			<header class="about-heading">
				<p class="eyebrow">The person behind the projects</p>
				<h1>about me, <em>more or less.</em></h1>
			</header>
			<figure class="about-artwork">
				<img src="/about.jpeg" alt="Two seated portraits of Thom Yorke against a white background" width="728" height="756" fetchpriority="high" />
			</figure>
			<div class="opening">
				<p>hi, i'm Anshu Man. The space in my name has a whole third-grade superhero story behind it (<a href="/posts/first_blog_post/">yes, really</a>).</p>
				<p>I studied computer science at Manipal and now work with AI and data systems. I like building things, but I also like finding out what happens after the nice demo: who can use the thing, what breaks when the data is wrong, and whether the idea still makes sense outside my laptop.</p>
			</div>

			<section class="about-section">
				<p class="section-number">01 / the throughline</p>
				<div>
					<h2>curiosity is doing most of the driving.</h2>
					<p>That curiosity has taken me from image and music experiments to compliance workflows, internal tools, and an Apple Watch app with a suspiciously familiar green dial. It also turned my mother's request for a Good Morning text into <a href="/posts/openclaw-second-brain/">a second brain</a>. I have a habit of following a small question further than planned.</p>
					<a href="/projects/">see what i've made ↗</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="about-section">
				<p class="section-number">02 / away from the editor</p>
				<div>
					<h2>when i'm not building</h2>
					<p>I read books and philosophy, listen to records that stay with me for years, and keep telling myself I'll finish a film. The questions I return to are usually about identity, meaning, and how much possibility fits inside a blank beginning. I don't have tidy answers. That's probably why I like them.</p>
					<p>Radiohead has been here for a while. Car Seat Headrest belongs in the conversation too.</p>
					<a href="/posts/">read the notes ↗</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="about-section about-contact">
				<p class="section-number">03 / your turn</p>
				<div>
					<h2>come say hi.</h2>
					<p>If you've got a problem worth thinking through, a project worth building, or a book I should read, I'd like to hear about it.</p>
					<div class="about-links">
						<a href="mailto:anshuwont@gmail.com">email ↗</a>
						<a href="https://github.com/ansh0eman" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github ↗</a>
						<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/anshuman-anshuman/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">linkedin ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</Section>
</Base>

<style>
	.about-page { --accent: #a94335; --muted: #57534e; --rule: rgb(120 113 108 / .42); padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) 0 4rem; }
	:global(.dark) .about-page { --accent: #df7564; --muted: #c2bbb3; --rule: rgb(168 162 158 / .32); }
	.eyebrow, .section-number { color: var(--accent); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.about-heading { max-width: 58rem; padding-bottom: 1.3rem; }
	h1 { margin: .8rem 0 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 6.5rem); letter-spacing: -.075em; line-height: 1.03; }
	h1 em { color: var(--accent); font-style: normal; }
	.about-artwork { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 0 0 clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); }
	.about-artwork img { display: block; width: min(78%, 44rem); height: auto; }
	.opening { max-width: 75ch; margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem); font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.9vw, 1.23rem); line-height: 1.8; }
	.opening p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
	.opening a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .25em; }
	.about-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, .32fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; padding: 2.2rem 0 2.8rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.about-section > div { max-width: 65ch; }
	h2 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
	.about-section p:not(.section-number) { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .89rem; line-height: 1.85; }
	.about-section a { display: inline-block; margin-top: .4rem; color: var(--accent); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .3em; }
	.about-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .8rem 1.5rem; }
	@media (max-width: 650px) { .about-artwork img { width: 100%; } .about-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .8rem; } }
</style>
